{
  "title": "Since I Was Reincarnated Into the Strongest Side Character Who Dies Early On, I'll Use my Game Knowledge to Become Unrivaled",
  "description": "A man who dies in a traffic accident is transmigrated in the world of [Echoes of Eternity], a game that he had played for a long time, and into the body of Silva Pierce. As the kingdom's strongest knight, Silva has cheat-level stats, and that makes him one of the best characters to become.\n\nHowever, he was also a character destined to die trying to save the protagonist and his companions at the end of the very first chapter...\n\nThe death event is unavoidable, and if he just left his companions and run away, the world would be destroyedーmaking it a certain game over!\n\nDetermined to oppose his fate of dying, Silva plans to use his knowledge of the game to take the shortest route possible to clear the game.\n\nSo, will Silva be able to survive his death events?!\n\nThe tenacious and strongest sub-character's transmigration fantasy begins nowー!!",
  "artist": "Shinjin",
  "author": "Mae D",
